<title>MALAYSIA: Kwong Yik to cut base rate to 9.20 pct.</title>
<headline>Kwong Yik to cut base rate to 9.20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Kwong Yik Bank Bhd said it will revise its base lending rate (BLR) to 9.20 percent from 9.25 percent from Saturday.</p>
<p>The national Bernama news agency quoted a bank statement as saying the revision was in line with the current cost of funds.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
